{"title": "Baldur's Mouth Gazette", "pageid": 40712, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Baldur's_Mouth_Gazette", "categories": ["Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BalMouthGazette1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/BalMouthGazette1.png/300px-BalMouthGazette1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/BalMouthGazette1.png/450px-BalMouthGazette1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/BalMouthGazette1.png/600px-BalMouthGazette1.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/BalMouthGazette1.png/300px-BalMouthGazette1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"371\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/BalMouthGazette1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Example issue of the gazette</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Baldur's Mouth Gazette</b> is the only printed source of information for <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> citizens.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jonah\" title=\"Jonah\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Portrait_Jonah.png/70px-Portrait_Jonah.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Portrait_Jonah.png/105px-Portrait_Jonah.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Portrait_Jonah.png/140px-Portrait_Jonah.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Portrait_Jonah.png/70px-Portrait_Jonah.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Portrait_Jonah.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Works great as toilet paper if you run out.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Jonah\" title=\"Jonah\">Jonah</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BalMouthGazette2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/BalMouthGazette2.png/100px-BalMouthGazette2.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/BalMouthGazette2.png/150px-BalMouthGazette2.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/BalMouthGazette2.png/200px-BalMouthGazette2.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/BalMouthGazette2.png/100px-BalMouthGazette2.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"124\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/BalMouthGazette2.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>First issue available to buy</figcaption></figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BalMouthGazette3.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/BalMouthGazette3.png/100px-BalMouthGazette3.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/BalMouthGazette3.png/150px-BalMouthGazette3.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/BalMouthGazette3.png/200px-BalMouthGazette3.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/BalMouthGazette3.png/100px-BalMouthGazette3.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"124\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/BalMouthGazette3.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Articles may contradict one another</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Baldur's Mouth Gazette is the only edition distributed within Baldur's Gate City and its suburbs. Unsurprisingly, it has become a powerful tool for swaying minds of baldurians for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>, when he started his endeavour to bring the city to his heel.\n</p><p>To achieve this, the Archduke nominee won to his side <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/25px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/38px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/50px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ettvard Needle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/25px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\">Ettvard Needle</a>, the editor-in-chief of the print medium. From the moment of their collusion, the gazette covers the city events solely and exclusively in favour of Gortash. The reporters are instructed to gather all the juiciest rumors and gossips, which later are cobbled into prejudiced and one-eyed articles.\n</p><p>As the plot goes on, the party might become an object of such slanted opinion on their actions. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stop_the_Presses\" title=\"Stop the Presses\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stop the Presses\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Stop_the_Presses\" title=\"Stop the Presses\">Stop the Presses</a> quest allows to find out all the lowdown of the gazette inner workings - and even to use it to their advantage.\n</p><p>The newspaper is a daily edition and can be bought for 2 gold pieces from News Hawkers positioned on several points throughout the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> All these are children trying to make some money for their families, though their attitude towards this occupation differs among the kids very much.\n</p><p>Also the newspaper can be bought from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lilly_Beanbottom\" title=\"Lilly Beanbottom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png/25px-Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png/38px-Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png/50px-Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lilly Beanbottom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png/25px-Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Lilly_Beanbottom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lilly_Beanbottom\" title=\"Lilly Beanbottom\">Lilly Beanbottom</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> a newstrader in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>, and from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silfy\" title=\"Silfy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Silfy.png/25px-Portrait_Silfy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Silfy.png/38px-Portrait_Silfy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Silfy.png/50px-Portrait_Silfy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silfy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Silfy.png/25px-Portrait_Silfy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Silfy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silfy\" title=\"Silfy\">Silfy</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> a tiefling girl previously met in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</span></h3>\n<p>Several issues of Baldur's Mouth Gazette might be found pinned on the advertisement board in the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</a>, near the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\">Chest of Grateful Words</a>. Those will reveal some events that happened between the final battle of the plot and the Epilogue, mostly reflecting the party's decisions through the game. However, some may turn out to be rather strange, containing headings contradictory to what the party's former companions tell them, or even clashing with one another.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_characters_involved\">Notable characters involved</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/30px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/45px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/60px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ettvard Needle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png/30px-Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Portrait_Ettvard_Needle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\">Ettvard Needle</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Estra_Stir\" title=\"Estra Stir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/30px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/45px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/60px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Estra Stir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/30px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Estra_Stir\" title=\"Estra Stir\">Estra Stir</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jelliwig\" title=\"Jelliwig\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Jelliwig.png/30px-Portrait_Jelliwig.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Jelliwig.png/45px-Portrait_Jelliwig.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Jelliwig.png/60px-Portrait_Jelliwig.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jelliwig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Jelliwig.png/30px-Portrait_Jelliwig.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Portrait_Jelliwig.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jelliwig\" title=\"Jelliwig\">Jelliwig</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lens\" title=\"Lens\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Lens.png/30px-Portrait_Lens.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Lens.png/45px-Portrait_Lens.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Lens.png/60px-Portrait_Lens.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lens\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Lens.png/30px-Portrait_Lens.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Portrait_Lens.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lens\" title=\"Lens\">Lens</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_related_characters\">Other related characters</span></h3>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bronte\" title=\"Bronte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Bronte.png/30px-Portrait_Bronte.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Bronte.png/45px-Portrait_Bronte.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Bronte.png/60px-Portrait_Bronte.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bronte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Bronte.png/30px-Portrait_Bronte.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Portrait_Bronte.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bronte\" title=\"Bronte\">Bronte</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-loiter_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-loiter-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chalara\" title=\"Chalara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Chalara.png/30px-Portrait_Chalara.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Chalara.png/45px-Portrait_Chalara.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Chalara.png/60px-Portrait_Chalara.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"News Hawker Chalara\" src=\"/w/image